sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Usuário (sk)
  participant API as API (ipm-user-api)
  participant DB as SSOT (banco ssot)
  participant P as Publisher (ipm-user-publisher)
  participant NATS as NATS (Stream DESIRED)
  participant CTRL as Controller (ipm-user-controller)
  participant ZIT as Zitadel (UserService / OrgService)

  Note over U,API: 1. Atualização com PATCH
  U->>API: PATCH /v1/ipm/users/{id} (Header: If-Match ou corpo: resourceVersion)
  API->>API: valida permissão ipm.user.update e regras de bind
  alt resourceVersion divergente
    API-->>U: 409 Conflict (OptimisticLockFailed)
  else sucesso na validação
    API->>DB: Transação SQL: UPDATE ipm.user (phase Reconciling, gen++), INSERT outbox
    API-->>U: 200 OK (Resource atualizado)
    P->>DB: drena outbox
    P->>NATS: publica manager.desired.ipm.user.<id>.changed
    NATS->>CTRL: entrega desired.changed
    CTRL->>CTRL: recalcula permissões efetivas a partir dos catálogos
    CTRL->>ZIT: atualiza userGrant no Project Grant da organização
    CTRL->>DB: UPDATE ipm.user SET phase = Ready, observed_generation = generation
  end

  Note over U,API: 2. Exclusão com DELETE
  U->>API: DELETE /v1/ipm/users/{id}?resourceVersion=N
  API->>API: valida permissão ipm.user.delete
  alt deletionProtection == true
    API-->>U: 409 Conflict (DeletionProtected)
  else sucesso na validação
    API->>DB: Transação SQL: UPDATE ipm.user SET lifecycle = absent, phase = Deleting, INSERT outbox
    API-->>U: 202 Accepted (Resource em Deleting)
    P->>DB: drena outbox
    P->>NATS: publica manager.desired.ipm.user.<id>.deleted
    NATS->>CTRL: entrega desired.deleted
    CTRL->>ZIT: RemoveUser(userId) na organização do cliente
    CTRL->>DB: DELETE FROM ipm.user WHERE resource_id = id
  end
